# Archive: old delivery reports, plans and unused screenshots. Kept on disk, out of the clone.
.archive/

# Prototypes: the .md specs stay tracked (code cites them); boards, refs and HTML stay local.
docs/prototypes/*
!docs/prototypes/*.md

# QA and perf run output: screenshots, logs and patches stay on disk.
/output/

# Media production and benchmark archives live in the private better-paseo-media repository.
images/
